  <section id="conversion-chart" class="content-section reveal" aria-label="Military Time Conversion Chart">
    <h2>5. Military Time Conversion Chart</h2>
    <p>
      Use the comprehensive hour-by-hour conversion table below to map the entire 24-hour day. This table displays standard 12-hour AM/PM values alongside four-digit military time codes and their correct spoken pronunciations:
    </p>

    <div class="table-wrap">
      <table aria-label="12-hour vs 24-hour conversion chart">
        <thead>
          <tr>
            <th>12-Hour Standard Time</th>
            <th>Military Time (24-Hour)</th>
            <th>Spoken Pronunciation</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody>
          <tr>
            <td>12:00 AM (Midnight)</td>
            <td>0000</td>
            <td>"Zero hundred hours" / "Zero zero zero zero"</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td>12:30 AM</td>
            <td>0030</td>
